 {
  "id": "c025",
  "loc_a": "docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-11.md:93",
  "quote_a": "`μ` computed by the KMS-slot policy signer (`service/signer-kms/`) from an `F` it has validated; `kms:Sign` only for that signer's role, with the issuer roles holding no KMS permission",
  "loc_b": "formal/p8/ENCODING-V1.md:557-559",
  "quote_b": "The issuer obtains `S_kms` (attestation and possession) from KMS with `MessageType EXTERNAL_MU` only, sending `μ = SHAKE256(SHAKE256(pk, 64) ‖ 0x00 ‖ 0x00 ‖ F, 64)`, pk the raw 1952-byte key (RFC 9881 Appendix D). The result is an ordinary pure signature over `F`. The verifier never sees μ and verifies over `F`.",
  "kind": "stale_referent",
