 {
  "id": "c090",
  "loc_a": "docs/V1-PROFILE.md:304-309",
  "quote_a": "- **Report encoding.** The stable-output object is the JCS object `{\"historical_security\":\"NOT_EVALUATED\",\n  \"reason\",\"revocation\":\"NOT_EVALUATED\",\"standing\":\"ABSENT/NOT_ISSUED_IN_PROFILE\",\"T\",\"verdict\"}`; the success\n  reason is `OK`.",
