328:   `declared_issue_time`: years 0001–9999, proleptic Gregorian, seconds 00–59. `issuer`: labels match
329:   `[a-z0-9-]{1,63}` with no leading or trailing hyphen; all-numeric labels, the top label included, are allowed; at
